    "body": "Thanks @ccameron-chromium and my apologies for the slow turnaround here. There's simply too many features in flight to keep track of them all and not enough people reviewing. 🙁 Nevertheless, I can appreciate that this was a bad experience and I hope that it'll go better next time. I do try to keep track of messages in https://whatwg.org/chat so that might be a good way to have a quick conversation about something you feel is lagging going forward.\n\nI filed https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/13235 to track the follow-up issue around defining bitmaps better so https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/10578 can keep its somewhat narrow scope. But you are probably right that it's a dependency.",
